    "taskTitle": "Design scalable and loosely coupled architectures",
    "inShort": "Serverless means AWS runs the servers for you. The core stack is API Gateway (front door) → Lambda (code) → DynamoDB (data), with S3 for static files. Lambda handles event-driven work up to 15 minutes; Fargate takes anything longer. To keep pieces from breaking each other, put SQS, SNS, EventBridge, or Step Functions between them.",
