    "type": "single",
    "stem": "Your organization attaches an SCP to an OU that allows only Amazon EC2 and Amazon S3 actions. An engineer reports that a role in a member account under that OU — a role whose IAM policy grants dynamodb:* — cannot access DynamoDB. Separately, the CISO worries the same SCP will block the security team's administrator role in the MANAGEMENT account. Which statement is CORRECT?",
