    "stem": "A regulated company keeps compliance documents in an S3 bucket in us-east-1. A new policy requires that a copy of every object be automatically maintained in a second AWS Region (eu-west-1) for disaster recovery and audit purposes, with new uploads replicated without manual intervention. Which approach BEST satisfies this requirement?",
