    "topicId": "d2-storage-resilience",
    "type": "multi",
    "stem": "An operations team wants to protect an S3 bucket so that (1) accidental overwrites and deletes of objects can be undone, and (2) older, superseded versions are automatically removed after 90 days to keep storage costs down. Which TWO actions together meet these requirements? (Choose TWO.)",
