    "stem": "A company runs production workloads on EBS-backed EC2 instances in us-west-2. The disaster recovery plan requires that, if the entire us-west-2 Region becomes unavailable, the team can restore the EBS volumes in us-east-1. Backups should be incremental and automated. Which approach MOST appropriately meets this requirement?",
