    "topicId": "d2-db-resilience",
    "type": "multi",
    "stem": "A financial services company runs a customer portal backed by a single Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL instance. The architecture team must satisfy TWO requirements: the database must automatically fail over to another Availability Zone with near-zero data loss, and a growing set of read-only dashboard queries must no longer compete with transactional writes. Which TWO actions together meet these requirements? (Choose TWO.)",
