    "topicId": "d3-db-perf",
    "type": "multi",
    "stem": "An e-commerce company runs its product catalog on Amazon RDS for MySQL. The workload is roughly 95% reads, and product pages become slow during peak shopping hours. You must improve read performance cost-effectively without changing the data model or application schema. Which TWO actions should you take? (Choose TWO.)",
