    "topicId": "d3-networking-perf",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A gaming studio runs a multiplayer game server fleet on EC2 instances behind Network Load Balancers in three AWS Regions. The game uses UDP, demands the lowest possible latency for players worldwide, and the studio must publish a small set of fixed IP addresses that players' corporate firewalls can allowlist. Which AWS service BEST meets these requirements?",
