    "topicId": "d3-networking-perf",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "An ad-tech company operates a real-time bidding endpoint that must sustain millions of requests per second with the lowest possible latency, absorb sudden traffic spikes without pre-warming, preserve the client source IP for their fraud filters, and expose a static IP address per Availability Zone. Traffic is plain TCP, not HTTP. Which load balancer is the HIGHEST performing fit?",
