    "topicId": "d3-data-analytics",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A mobile gaming company ingests a high-volume clickstream. Several independent applications must each process the SAME records in real time (sub-second), and the platform must be able to replay the last 24 hours of events if a consumer fails. The developers plan to write custom processing logic using the Kinesis Client Library (KCL). Which service meets these requirements?",
