    "stem": "A company wants to build a fully serverless data lake on Amazon S3. It needs to (1) automatically discover and catalog the schema of raw files as they arrive and (2) let analysts run ad-hoc SQL queries over that data without provisioning or managing any clusters. Which TWO services should the architecture use? (Choose TWO.)",
