    "topicId": "d3-data-analytics",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A media production company must migrate 200 TB of archived footage from an on-premises data center into Amazon S3. The site has a slow, unreliable internet link, and the migration must finish in days rather than weeks. Some source files contain unusual characters in their names. Which approach is the MOST appropriate, and what must the team ensure?",
