    "topicId": "d3-migration",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A company is migrating a 4 TB self-managed MySQL database running on-premises to Amazon RDS for MySQL. The business requires that the on-premises database remain fully available to the application throughout the migration, with only a brief cutover window at the very end. Which AWS service is designed to migrate the data while continuously replicating ongoing changes so downtime is minimal?",
