    "inShort": "DMS does a full load then change data capture, so the source stays live until a short cutover; MySQL to MySQL is same-engine, so DMS alone.",
    "trap": "SCT (D) tempts because it is the other 'DB migration' tool, but it only converts schema for different engines and moves no data at all."
