    "stem": "A financial services company is migrating a 6 TB commercial Oracle database to Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL to eliminate licensing costs. The Oracle schema contains many PL/SQL stored procedures and triggers. The source database must stay online serving production traffic until the final cutover. Which TWO AWS tools/services are required to complete this heterogeneous migration? (Choose TWO.)",
