    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A company is closing an on-premises data center and must migrate roughly 250 mixed Windows and Linux application servers (a combination of VMware VMs and some physical machines) to Amazon EC2. Leadership wants a lift-and-shift (rehost) with minimal application changes and the shortest possible cutover downtime, using continuous replication of the servers before cutover. Which AWS service is PURPOSE-BUILT for this migration?",
