    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A media company stores 40 TB of legal contracts in Amazon S3. Each file is accessed only a few times per month, but when auditors request one it must be retrieved within milliseconds. The company wants durability across multiple Availability Zones and lower storage cost than S3 Standard. Which S3 storage class is the MOST cost-effective fit?",
