    "stem": "A company is closing an on-premises data center. They must (1) move an existing 200 TB archive into Amazon S3 within two weeks over a slow, already-saturated internet link, and (2) afterward continuously replicate 500 GB of newly generated files to Amazon S3 each night. Which TWO services BEST meet these needs? (Choose TWO.)",
