    "inShort": "Stateless, retriable queue tasks with no hard deadline are a textbook Spot fit behind Auto Scaling.",
    "trap": "On-Demand at fixed capacity feels 'safe' but pays the highest rate and wastes the ~90% Spot discount for clearly interruptible work.",
