    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A company runs a fleet of EC2 instances providing a steady, predictable 24/7 baseline of web traffic. The team also plans to migrate part of the platform to AWS Fargate and AWS Lambda over the next year and wants a single commitment that keeps giving a discount even as they shift compute between EC2 families and serverless. Which commitment provides the MOST flexibility for this goal?",
