    "topicId": "d4-compute-cost",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A startup is launching a new internal reporting tool. It is invoked sporadically, only during business hours, a few hundred times a day, and each execution runs for under 10 seconds transforming a small JSON payload. Average compute utilization would be very low if hosted on a continuously running server. The team wants the LOWEST cost with no servers to manage. Which compute option should you recommend?",
