    "stem": "A company commits to a 3-year Compute Savings Plan sized to its steady baseline. During a promotional event, one Availability Zone becomes constrained and On-Demand launches for their required instance type start failing with insufficient-capacity errors at the exact moment they need guaranteed capacity in that AZ. Which statement correctly explains the situation and the fix?",
