    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A company runs Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL for a batch reporting job. During one billing period, one DB instance ran for exactly 5 hours and a second, identical DB instance ran for exactly 3 hours and 30 minutes. Both are the same instance class, and neither was stopped or restarted during the run. How many DB instance-hours will AWS bill for this activity?",
