    "inShort": "At a steady 60 TB/month, Direct Connect's lower per-GB rate more than pays back its fixed monthly cost, and throughput stops fluctuating.",
    "trap": "A second VPN tunnel — feels like the cheap, quick fix, but it still runs over the public internet at the higher per-GB rate and throughput stays unpredictable.",
    "confusableId": "cmp-dx-vpn"
