    "stem": "Two microservices run in different VPCs in the same Region and exchange a large, constant stream of data with each other. There is no requirement to connect any other VPCs, and the team wants to avoid any per-hour connectivity charge for linking just these two VPCs. Which connectivity option is the MOST cost-effective?",
