    "stem": "Your company runs a real-time multiplayer game backend that accepts millions of UDP packets per second and requires the lowest possible latency. Corporate customers must allowlist your endpoint in their on-premises firewalls, which only accept fixed IP addresses — not DNS names. Which load balancing solution MOST closely meets these requirements?",
