    "stem": "You are advising an engineering team on storage placement for a new workload. They must store 40 TB of user-uploaded video that is served over HTTPS to a web app, and they also need a scratch area on each EC2 instance for temporary transcoding buffers where maximum IOPS matters and data loss on instance termination is acceptable. Which TWO storage services should you recommend? (Choose TWO.)",
