    "inShort": "Lustre throughput equals size times the per-TiB tier; 12 TiB at 200 MB/s per TiB hits 2,400 MB/s.",
    "trap": "The 4.8 TiB option tempts by showing the top 200 MB/s per TiB tier, but throughput is multiplied by size — and it cannot even hold the dataset."
