    "stem": "You are the solutions architect for a hospital group. National regulation requires that patient imaging data never leave the hospital's own premises, yet the clinical team wants to build new applications using the same EC2, EBS, and Amazon ECS APIs and tooling they already use in the eu-west-1 Region, managed from the AWS Management Console. The hospital has a suitable data center with space, power, and network connectivity. Which solution BEST meets these requirements?",
