    "topicId": "d4-storage-cost",
    "type": "multi",
    "stem": "As a solutions architect, you are costing out a design that uploads 200 TB of on-premises data into an S3 bucket in us-east-1 over the internet, then has EC2 instances in us-east-1 read it, and finally replicates the bucket to eu-west-1 for DR. Which TWO statements about AWS data-transfer charges for this design are correct? (Choose TWO.)",
