    "inShort": "Only NLB does UDP at Layer 4 with preserved source IPs and a static IP per Availability Zone.",
    "trap": "Global Accelerator + ALB gives static IPs but ALB is HTTP-only — the UDP requirement alone eliminates every ALB answer."
