    "topicId": "d1-network-security",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "You run a high-profile public API on an Application Load Balancer fronted by CloudFront for a payments company. The business requires an SLA-backed DDoS guarantee, 24/7 access to a dedicated DDoS response team during attacks, and protection against the surprise bill when a volumetric attack forces Auto Scaling to scale out. Which service delivers all of this?",
