    "domainId": "d1",
    "topicId": "d1-network-security",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "You are the security architect for an AWS Organization with 60 accounts. You must guarantee that the same AWS WAF web ACL and a baseline set of security-group rules are applied to every existing Application Load Balancer AND automatically to any new ALB created in any account, with configuration drift remediated centrally. What should you use?",
