    "topicId": "d1-data-protection",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "You are the solutions architect at a health-tech startup preparing to store protected health information (PHI) on AWS. Before go-live, your compliance officer needs two artifacts: a signed HIPAA Business Associate Addendum (BAA) with AWS, and AWS's most recent SOC 2 Type II report to forward to an external auditor. Which single AWS service provides BOTH of these?",
