      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "Scratch file systems replicate across three AZs, so the loss indicates a defect; reopen a support case rather than change the design."
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "Convert the scratch file system to EFS One Zone, which is durable across AZs."
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "Enable Multi-AZ on the Lustre scratch file system to add durability."
      }
