    "type": "single",
    "stem": "You are reviewing an architecture that uses an Application Load Balancer with subnets enabled in two Availability Zones, an Amazon SQS queue, and AWS Lambda functions, all in a single Region. A consultant recommends 'deploying a second ALB and a second SQS queue in another AZ for high availability.' As the solutions architect, what is the MOST accurate response?",
