    "topicId": "d3-storage-perf",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A manufacturing company runs a factory-floor quality-control application that must analyze camera images and drive equipment with single-digit-millisecond latency, entirely within the plant. The team wants to keep using the same Amazon EC2 and Amazon EBS APIs and tooling they already use in the Region, but the round trip to the nearest AWS Region is roughly 60 ms — far too slow for the control loop. Which option BEST meets the requirement?",
