    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A European bank must keep certain customer objects physically within its own data center to satisfy a data-residency regulation. Its application already stores and retrieves those objects using the Amazon S3 API, and the team does not want to rewrite the application. Which approach satisfies the residency rule while preserving the S3 API?",
