    "inShort": "A single flow caps near 5 Gbps; parallelize into multiple flows (or use ENA Express) to use full bandwidth.",
    "trap": "A larger instance raises aggregate bandwidth but not the ~5 Gbps single-flow ceiling; the fix is parallel flows, not a bigger instance."
