    "topicId": "d3-networking-perf",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "You front an application with Amazon CloudFront and must serve HTTPS on a custom domain using an ACM certificate. Your ALB origin runs in eu-west-1, where you already imported the ACM certificate. When you open the CloudFront distribution's viewer certificate settings, your eu-west-1 certificate does not appear in the list. What is the reason, and the correct fix?",
