    "stem": "Your backend application must record the real client source IP for every request for fraud analysis. It currently sits behind an Application Load Balancer, and a developer insists 'the ALB hides client IPs, so we can't get them.' You are deciding whether to keep the ALB or move to a Network Load Balancer. Which statement is correct?",
