      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "You must enable Proxy Protocol v2 on the Global Accelerator listener to recover the end-user IP."
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "You must replace the ALB with a Network Load Balancer, because Global Accelerator client IP preservation works only with NLB endpoints."
      }
