    "type": "single",
    "stem": "You are the network engineer for a logistics firm that has just installed a 1 Gbps Direct Connect connection. On-premises applications need consistent, non-internet access to Amazon S3, Amazon SQS, and Amazon DynamoDB public endpoints in three different AWS Regions. No VPC resources are involved. Which configuration is the MOST appropriate?",
