    "stem": "You are the solutions architect for a satellite-imaging company that must move a 500 TB image archive from its ground station into Amazon S3 before a lease expires in six weeks. The ground station's internet link is 500 Mbps and is already needed for daily operations. Which approach is the MOST cost-effective way to complete the migration in time?",
