    "stem": "As the architect at a media company on an Enterprise Support plan, you discover that a decommissioning project left behind hundreds of Amazon EBS volumes that are no longer attached to any instance, plus unassociated Elastic IP addresses. You want an AWS-native report that identifies these specific wasted resources so your team can delete them. Which service should you use?",
