    "topicId": "d4-cost-governance",
    "type": "multi",
    "stem": "You are the cloud governance lead for an organization whose 30 member accounts must all tag EC2 and RDS resources with a CostCenter key. Today you find the key spelled costcenter, Cost_Center, and CostCentre across accounts, and roughly 15% of new resources launch with no tag at all, which breaks the chargeback report. You want to standardize the key going forward, block new untagged launches, and detect existing non-compliant resources. Which THREE actions together achieve this? (Choose THREE.)",
