    "id": "d4-compute-cost-35",
    "domainId": "d4",
    "topicId": "d4-compute-cost",
    "type": "multi",
    "stem": "After introducing a nightly shutdown for a 40-instance development environment, your finance team reports that the environment's monthly bill dropped far less than the 65% you projected. Each instance is an m6i.xlarge with a 500 GiB gp3 root volume, and the environment sits behind an Application Load Balancer that was left in place. Which TWO charges continue to accrue while the instances are stopped? (Choose TWO.)",
